<h2 style="color:#18181b; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:14pt; margin-bottom:6pt; border-bottom:1px solid #e4e4e7; padding-bottom:3pt;">DECLARATION</h2>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">I, <strong>[Student Name]</strong> (Student ID: <strong>1279/16</strong>), declare that this internship report entitled <strong>"Design and Implementation of WOW Burger Restaurant Management and Digital Ordering Web Application"</strong> is my original work carried out during my practical industrial internship at <strong>Enin Tech Solutions PLC</strong> between <strong>04/07/2026</strong> and <strong>29/08/2026</strong>. This work has not been presented or submitted previously for any degree, diploma, or academic award at Haramaya University or any other academic institution. All technical resources, literature, tools, and documentation cited herein have been duly acknowledged.</p>
