<h2 style="color:#18181b; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:14pt; margin-bottom:6pt; border-bottom:1px solid #e4e4e7; padding-bottom:3pt;">APPROVAL SHEET</h2>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">This internship report has been submitted to the Department of Software Engineering, College of Computing and Informatics, Haramaya University, with our approval as the respective industrial immediate supervisor and academic department advisor.</p>
<h3 style="color:#27272a; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:4pt;">**1. Hosting Organization Immediate Supervisor:**</h3>
<li style="margin-left:20pt; margin-bottom:3pt; font-size:11pt;">**Name:** Andargachew Akalu</li>
<li style="margin-left:20pt; margin-bottom:3pt; font-size:11pt;">**Designation:** Software Developer</li>
<li style="margin-left:20pt; margin-bottom:3pt; font-size:11pt;">**Organization:** Enin Tech Solutions PLC</li>
