<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #d4d4d8; margin:14pt 0;" />
<br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always; mso-break-type:section-break" />
<h2 style="color:#18181b; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:14pt; margin-bottom:6pt; border-bottom:1px solid #e4e4e7; padding-bottom:3pt;">EXECUTIVE SUMMARY</h2>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">This industrial internship report documents the two-month engineering engagement (July 4, 2026 – August 29, 2026) conducted at <strong>Enin Tech Solutions PLC</strong> in partial fulfillment of the requirements for the Bachelor of Science Degree in Software Engineering at <strong>Haramaya University</strong>. Under the direct industrial supervision of <strong>Mr. Andargachew Akalu</strong> (Software Developer) and academic mentorship of <strong>Mr. Mekonen. (M.Sc., Lecturer)</strong>, the author was embedded in the core Web Application and Software Development Engineering team.</p>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">The focal engineering assignment was the end-to-end design, implementation, debugging, and verification of the <strong>WOW Burger Restaurant Management and Digital Ordering Web Application</strong>. WOW Burger is a multi-branch fast-food restaurant franchise operating across major districts of Addis Ababa (Bole, Kazanchis, and Piassa). The enterprise faced acute operational bottlenecks stemming from manual paper menus, branch inventory discrepancies, table order delivery errors, and lack of centralized sales visibility.</p>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">To overcome these challenges, a modern, decoupled three-tier web platform was engineered:</p>
<li style="margin-left:20pt; margin-bottom:3pt; font-size:11pt;">**Frontend Architecture:** A responsive Single Page Application (SPA) built using **React 18**, **Vite 5**, and **Tailwind CSS**, featuring interactive OpenStreetMap branch geolocation via **Leaflet**, an accessible shopping cart drawer, dine-in and takeaway checkout flows, theme switching (dark/light), and comprehensive WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility features.</li>
<li style="margin-left:20pt; margin-bottom:3pt; font-size:11pt;">**Backend API Services:** A scalable **Node.js** and **Express 5** RESTful API implementing modular routing, secure authentication via **JSON Web Tokens (JWT)**, password salting and hashing with **BcryptJS**, role-based access control (Superadmin vs. Branch Manager), and **atomic database transactions** for order and order-item creation.</li>
<li style="margin-left:20pt; margin-bottom:3pt; font-size:11pt;">**Relational Database:** A robust **MySQL** schema (`wow_burger`) comprising six relational tables (`branches`, `categories`, `products`, `users`, `orders`, `order_items`) with foreign key constraints, composite unique indexing, and fiscal VAT (15%) calculation.</li>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">During the development cycle, significant industrial engineering challenges were diagnosed and resolved, including resolving an ES module syntax error that caused blank screen rendering, establishing multi-item ACID transaction guarantees, and integrating branch-specific menu fallbacks. The production build transformed 1,630 modules in 50.93 seconds with zero bundling errors, and all 16 API endpoints achieved a 100% pass rate in verification testing. This experience substantially enhanced the intern's technical, problem-solving, collaborative, and professional work-ethic capabilities.</p>
<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #d4d4d8; margin:14pt 0;" />
<br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always; mso-break-type:section-break" />
<h2 style="color:#18181b; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14pt; font-weight:bold; margin-top:14pt; margin-bottom:6pt; border-bottom:1px solid #e4e4e7; padding-bottom:3pt;">ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS</h2>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">First and foremost, I express my sincere gratitude to the Almighty God for providing me with strength, health, wisdom, and perseverance throughout the entire internship duration and during the preparation of this report.</p>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">I would like to extend my deepest appreciation to my hosting organization, <strong>Enin Tech Solutions PLC</strong>, for offering me this valuable internship opportunity and granting me full access to their engineering facilities, development environments, and collaborative professional workspace.</p>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">Special thanks and profound gratitude go to my immediate industrial supervisor, <strong>Mr. Andargachew Akalu</strong> (Software Developer), whose continuous technical guidance, constructive code reviews, patient mentorship, and profound industry insights greatly enriched my software engineering knowledge and practical capabilities.</p>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">I also wish to express my heartfelt thanks to my academic department advisor, <strong>Mr. Mekonen. (M.Sc., Lecturer)</strong>, for his invaluable academic advice, timely feedback, and continuous support in ensuring that this industrial training aligned with the academic standards of Haramaya University's Department of Software Engineering.</p>
<p style="font-size:11pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8pt; text-align:justify;">Finally, I am indebted to the faculty of the <strong>College of Computing and Informatics at Haramaya University</strong> for building my theoretical foundations, and to my beloved family and colleagues whose unreserved moral support and encouragement sustained me throughout this industrial journey.</p>
<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #d4d4d8; margin:14pt 0;" />
<br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always; mso-break-type:section-break" />
